<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CalEnergy raised to a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CalEnergy raised to a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Daniele Seitz said in a research note she raised the recommendation on CalEnergy Co Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The 12-month price target is $53 per share, &quot;or 20 times our 1998 (earnings) estimate of $2.65 per share.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 39-3/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
